WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.450
The smoke test prints eight
passes: the seven checks,

2
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:07.087
with the policy check run once
for each workload policy.

3
00:00:07.087 --> 00:00:10.325
The synthetic app has
two owners and no secret.

4
00:00:10.325 --> 00:00:14.262
A new secret is refused, though
that error is the fixture's own,

5
00:00:14.262 --> 00:00:16.625
since Learn doesn't give the real one.

6
00:00:16.625 --> 00:00:19.437
The sign-ins show the report-only results.

7
00:00:19.437 --> 00:00:23.088
And the test host can retrieve the
group managed account's password.

8
00:00:23.088 --> 00:00:27.320
Then the rollback is planned from the
preflight's snapshot: seven actions,

9
00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:31.137
including the synthetic objects'
cleanup, and none of them a delete.

10
00:00:31.137 --> 00:00:35.330
Applied with its hash but without
the apply switch, it's a dry run.
